// redis.down = true  ⇒ every command rejects with Error('connect ECONNREFUSED 127.0.0.1:6379').
// redis.maxKeys = n  ⇒ "maxmemory, policy noeviction": a write that would create key n+1 fails with ReplyError OOM.
class FakeRedis {
